sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub Service<br/>(sidecar)
    participant Adapter as GarakAdapter Pod<br/>K8s Job
    participant Garak as Garak Subprocess<br/>0.15.0+rhaiv.5
    participant Target as Target Model<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Judge as Judge Model<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SDGModel as SDG Model<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KFP as KFP API<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS

    Note over EvalHub,Adapter: Flow 1: Simple Mode Scan

    EvalHub->>Adapter: JobSpec (ConfigMap mount)<br/>K8s RBAC
    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse JobSpec, resolve config<br/>(7-step API key resolution)
    Adapter->>Garak: Launch subprocess<br/>CLI args + generator options
    Garak->>Target: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Target-->>Garak: Model responses
    Garak-->>Adapter: JSONL reports (local filesystem)
    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse results<br/>(TBSA, ASR aggregates)
    Adapter->>OCI: Push scan artifacts<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Registry creds
    Adapter->>MLflow: Log metrics + HTML report<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Adapter->>EvalHub: Status callback (localhost HTTP)<br/>Result submission

    Note over Adapter,KFP: Flow 2: KFP Mode Scan

    Adapter->>KFP: create_run_from_pipeline_func<br/>TLS / SA token or sidecar proxy
    KFP-->>Adapter: Run ID

    Note right of KFP: 6-step pipeline executes:
    Note right of KFP: 1. validate
    Note right of KFP: 2. resolve_taxonomy
    Note right of KFP: 3. sdg_generate
    Note right of KFP: 4. prepare_prompts
    Note right of KFP: 5. garak_scan
    Note right of KFP: 6. write_kfp_outputs

    KFP->>S3: Upload/download artifacts<br/>TLS 1.2+ / AWS IAM
    KFP->>Target: Garak probes<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Adapter->>KFP: Poll get_run status
    KFP-->>Adapter: Run completed
    Adapter->>S3: Download scan results<br/>TLS 1.2+ / AWS IAM
    Adapter->>OCI: Push artifacts<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Registry creds

    Note over Adapter,Judge: Flow 3: Intents Mode (SDG + Multi-Model)

    Adapter->>SDGModel: Generate adversarial prompts<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token (SDG_API_KEY)
    SDGModel-->>Adapter: Synthetic prompts
    Adapter->>Garak: Launch with intents config
    Garak->>Target: Adversarial prompts<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token (TARGET)
    Target-->>Garak: Responses
    Garak->>Judge: Evaluate responses<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token (JUDGE_API_KEY)
    Judge-->>Garak: Classifications
    Garak->>Garak: Attacker generates<br/>new prompts (TAP)
    Garak-->>Adapter: Intents scan results
    Adapter->>Adapter: Generate ART HTML report<br/>(Jinja2 heatmaps)
